# The same stack as gives-up, with a higher threshold.
#
# Two fixtures differing by this one number is the point: the tests read it
# from here, so the pair proves autoheal honours the setting rather than
# happening to behave the way one fixture describes. A threshold that was
# ignored -- hardcoded, off by one, or read once and cached -- passes at 2 and
# fails here.
CRASHLOOP_STRIKES=4
